   +`<p>This runway takes the share s = ${dd?.sideShare??'—'} of the whole-crane side thrust (${e(dd?.distributionSource??'')}); no share below 0.5 is credited without a stiffness analysis of both runways, so the code minimum per runway is max(s, 0.5) times the whole-crane value.</p>`
   +`<h3>Crane design loads: code minimum against the supplier value</h3>`+table(['Load','AIST TR-13 minimum','ASCE 7-16 minimum','Supplier','Governing value · source','Per wheel'],rows,'load-basis')
